<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<page xmlns="http://projectmallard.org/1.0/" type="topic" id="ui-prompt">
  <info>
    <link type="guide" xref="index"/>
    <desc>Enter and submit a request to the active model.</desc>
  </info>
  <title>Prompt Area</title>
  <p>Enter a request in the prompt area and choose <gui style="button">Send</gui>. Press <key>Return</key>, keypad Enter, or <key>Ctrl</key>+<key>Return</key> to submit. Press <key>Shift</key>+<key>Return</key> or <key>Alt</key>+<key>Return</key> to insert a new line.</p>
  <p>See <link xref="send-prompt">Send a Prompt</link> for the complete task.</p>
</page>
